{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> owns a house worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa99661f0d3cb72d6adde9b8d0ba27d67e1ac9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />. He sells it to Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% profit. Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> sells the house back to Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% loss. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6e15a15e9ee6e62feb896170414c20dbae8cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Mr. A comes out even}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Mr. A makes } \\textdollar{ 100}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Mr. A makes } \\textdollar{ 1000}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Mr. B loses } \\textdollar{ 100}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of the above is correct}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"616\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa99661f0d3cb72d6adde9b8d0ba27d67e1ac9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> to start with (the house) and Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29a4941ffea026c013d439763edeb6d8c6da9e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{11000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> sells the house to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29a4941ffea026c013d439763edeb6d8c6da9e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{11000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, leaving Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29a4941ffea026c013d439763edeb6d8c6da9e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{11000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> and Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa99661f0d3cb72d6adde9b8d0ba27d67e1ac9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{10000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Then, Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> sells the house back to Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f216da61f91e4b47b117f885b36884d0813982f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{9000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, which leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a7d65eb2ab1064078f688526c7540e8ece0725f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{12000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f216da61f91e4b47b117f885b36884d0813982f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{9000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> gained <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/756fbba042cee13735b716278ae355fe6252467f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> out of Mr. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s expense, but none of the options says this. We can therefore conclude that the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.ph